<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/doi-10-1162-imag-a-00032> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:rfddbccaa77e19bdbb20eae14_n0e9be63809fc410aa01f91ecce4363a3b7 .
