_:r2fec26c7b4bd59b32940b6df_ne85bb241ff9b40478a07ee8303428a68b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Decoding the Large-Scale Structure of Brain Function by Classifying Mental States Across Individuals" .
_:r2fec26c7b4bd59b32940b6df_ne85bb241ff9b40478a07ee8303428a68b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/locator> .
